details: "
[accent]Appearance: fifth generation
[lightgrey]
One of the last rouge cores that 
remained on serpulo

Had taken part in the third eradication
[grey]
The greatest faction of all

the only faction to have truly
conquered serpulo

Now they gaze upon the stars
as they search for a new place to
call their home

Unbeknownst to them they would
only reignite the same cycle
so many had to endure through

the same mistake

How[accent] credulous
"
